00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:47.450
We've got the cold open.
我们有冷场开场白。

324
00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:51.990
In the very first few seconds, Pam is stuffing the Christmas envelopes, the Christmas photo.
就在最初的几秒钟里，帕姆在装圣诞信封，也就是圣诞照片。

325
00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:52.350
Yeah.
对。

326
00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:52.830
Right?
是吧？

327
00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:54.530
She's doing the Christmas card mass mailing.
她在批量寄送圣诞贺卡。

328
00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:55.230
The Christmas card.
圣诞贺卡。

329
00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:57.250
I did this at 1-800-DENTISt.
我在1-800-DENTIST做过这个。

330
00:11:57.510 --> 00:12:00.810
Oh, you did the 1-800-DENTIST company Christmas card mailing?
哦，你做过1-800-DENTIST公司的圣诞贺卡群发？

331
00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:01.350
I did.
我做过。

332
00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:06.690
I volunteered, and you got to hop off the phone so you didn't have to talk to people about their rotten teeth.
我自告奋勇去的，这样就能不用接电话，也就不用跟别人讨论他们那口烂牙了。

333
00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:11.390
And I would go in the mailroom, and they'd be playing Christmas music, and I'd have a cup of tea,
然后我会去收发室，那里会放着圣诞音乐，我还会端着一杯茶，

334
00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:14.390
and I would just stuff envelopes all day, and I was so happy.
我一整天就在那儿装信封，我可高兴了。

335
00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:15.150
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

336
00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:18.650
I did many, many mass mailings as an administrative assistant.
作为行政助理，我做过很多很多次批量群发。

337
00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:24.910
I'd have to bind things, copy on both sides, collate, bind, and mail.
我得装订文件、双面复印、配页、装订然后寄出。

338
00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:27.750
I am very happy doing those things.
我做这些事情的时候非常开心。

339
00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:33.230
Okay, but the photo was our cast photo that we took, our Christmas photo.
好吧，但那张照片是我们拍的演员合影，我们的圣诞照片。

