They photoshopped Kate's head onto Henriette's body for the picture I'm stuffing into the envelope in this episode.
在这集里我塞进信封的那张照片里，他们把凯特的头P到了亨丽埃特的身体上。

365
00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:41.270
I really want that card.
我真的很想要那张卡片。

366
00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:42.170
Dang it.
可恶。

367
00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:49.510
Yeah, because I can see it's Henriette's hand on her hip in the sweater that's hanging in my office, but Kate's face.
对，因为我能看出挂在我办公室里那件毛衣上叉着腰的手是亨丽埃特的，但脸却是凯特的。

368
00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:51.770
Way to go, Jenna.
干得漂亮，珍娜。

369
00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:54.430
So far, we've covered one second of the episode.
到目前为止，我们才讲了这集的头一秒钟。

370
00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:56.590
That happens in the first one to three seconds.
这发生在第一到第三秒之间。

371
00:13:56.610 --> 00:14:02.330
The next thing that happens is that Michael and Dwight enter with the tree, and it's really way too big.
接下来发生的事是迈克尔和德怀特扛着圣诞树进来了，而且这棵树真的太大了。

