00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:21.730
We're dressed kind of similar.
我们穿得有点像。

413
00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:22.550
Very similarly.
非常像。

414
00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:23.650
What's that about?
怎么回事？

415
00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:26.870
I don't know, but Phyllis has a full Christmas blouse and veSt.
我不知道，但菲莉丝穿着全套的圣诞衬衫和马甲。

416
00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:28.270
I love her Christmas veSt.
我很喜欢她的圣诞马甲。

417
00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:30.810
My sister's a school teacher and she does that.
我姐姐是学校老师，她也这样。

418
00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:33.650
Like at Christmas time, she wears all these Christmas sweaters and vests.
比如到了圣诞节，她会穿所有这些圣诞毛衣和马甲。

419
00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:35.150
You know I love this stuff.
你知道我喜欢这些东西。

420
00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:36.410
I've got all of it.
我全都有。

