00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:47.830
and she sends me Christmas hoodies, Christmas vests, Christmas pajamas, Christmas everything.
然后她会寄给我圣诞连帽衫、圣诞马甲、圣诞睡衣、所有圣诞的东西。

