1227
00:49:40.340 --> 00:49:41.300
than an iPod?
比iPod好呢？

1228
00:49:41.300 --> 00:49:46.080
And this moment kind of broke my heart, too, when Dwight goes, I never said it was better.
而这一刻也挺让我心碎的，当德怀特说，我从来没说过它更好。

1229
00:49:46.300 --> 00:49:46.860
You know?
你知道吗？

1230
00:49:47.540 --> 00:49:50.260
Wait, I have an Angela pissed off in this moment.
等等，我这里有个安吉拉很生气的片段。

1231
00:49:50.380 --> 00:49:51.060
Oh, okay, go.
哦，好的，放吧。

1232
00:49:51.060 --> 00:49:55.480
At 13 minutes, 58 seconds, look at my face.
在13分58秒时，看我的表情。

1233
00:49:55.660 --> 00:49:57.000
I wrote it in all caps.
我用全大写字母把这记下来了。

1234
00:49:57.340 --> 00:50:03.400
So, Michael has just called Meredith a sucker because she got the lame, you know, oven mitt.
所以，迈克尔刚管梅雷迪思叫了冤大头，因为她拿到了那个糟糕的烤箱隔热手套。

1235
00:50:03.600 --> 00:50:05.700
And Phyllis storms out, okay?
然后菲莉丝夺门而出，对吧？

1236
00:50:05.920 --> 00:50:06.160
Yeah.
对。

1237
00:50:06.160 --> 00:50:07.760
She is completely heartbroken now.
她现在完全心碎了。

1238
00:50:07.840 --> 00:50:09.620
And the party is falling apart.
而且派对也要开不下去了。

1239
00:50:09.780 --> 00:50:10.020
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1240
00:50:10.020 --> 00:50:14.940
And the look on my face is just sheer in, like, rage.
我脸上的表情简直就是纯粹的愤怒。

1241
00:50:15.320 --> 00:50:17.360
Now, are we at the top of your rage now?
