00:51:21.300 --> 00:51:21.360
No.
没错。

1273
00:51:21.500 --> 00:51:22.000
She doesn't.
她不知道。

1274
00:51:22.060 --> 00:51:24.240
I think it's kind of an innocent moment, honestly.
说实话，我觉得这其实挺单纯的。

1275
