Like, these were not meant to be Yankee Swap gifts.
这些本来就不是用来当 Yankee Swap（白象交换礼物）的礼物。

1281
00:51:38.740 --> 00:51:39.300
They were not.
根本不是。

1282
00:51:39.560 --> 00:51:41.080
They were meant for certain people.
它们是特意为某些人准备的。

1283
