Yeah.
对。

1295
00:52:08.180 --> 00:52:09.540
They made it snow there, too.
他们连那里也弄了下雪特效。

1296
00:52:09.840 --> 00:52:10.440
I don't know.
我不知道。

1297
00:52:10.540 --> 00:52:11.120
Nice detail.
不错的细节。

1298
00:52:11.320 --> 00:52:11.780
Nice touch.
不错的点缀。

1299
00:52:12.000 --> 00:52:12.580
Good continuity.
连贯性真好。

1300
00:52:12.820 --> 00:52:13.440
Veda was on it.
Veda 真用心。

1301
00:52:13.620 --> 00:52:18.820
Well, I read that our writers found out in Pennsylvania that if you work at a liquor
嗯，我读到我们的编剧在宾夕法尼亚州发现，如果你在一家酒类

