store, you have to wear a tie.
商店工作，你就必须系领带。

1303
00:52:20.180 --> 00:52:20.580
Yes.
是的。

1304
00:52:20.580 --> 00:52:25.480
And so, that was part of this character description, is that he had to have on a tie.
所以，这也是这个角色设定的一部分，就是他必须系领带。

1305
00:52:25.680 --> 00:52:26.280
Isn't that great?
这不是很棒吗？

1306
00:52:26.440 --> 00:52:30.500
And I thought the actor, his name is Ryan Martin, did a fantastic job.
而且我觉得那个演员，他叫瑞安·马丁，表现得太棒了。

1307
00:52:30.640 --> 00:52:30.740
So good.
太棒了。

1308
00:52:30.740 --> 00:52:33.360
He just really, like, takes in all of that vodka.
他真的很像是把所有的伏特加都吸收进去了。

1309
00:52:34.300 --> 00:52:35.080
Fifteen bottles.
十五瓶。

1310
00:52:35.140 --> 00:52:35.900
Fifteen bottles.
十五瓶。

1311
00:52:37.120 --> 00:52:37.560
Craziness.
太疯狂了。

1312
00:52:38.140 --> 00:52:38.540
Okay.
好。

1313
00:52:38.540 --> 00:52:40.200
So, then we go back to the party.
那么，接下来我们回到派对上。

1314
00:52:40.360 --> 00:52:45.720
Michael brings all this vodka back into the party, and at 16, 10 minutes, this is the
迈克尔把这些伏特加带回了派对，在16分10秒的时候，这是

1315
