00:53:22.320 --> 00:53:26.380
this Christmas party to be like, and I quote, a Playboy Mansion party.
这个圣诞派对就像是，我原话引述，“花花公子庄园派对”。

1335
00:53:26.620 --> 00:53:26.800
Yeah.
是的。

1336
00:53:27.080 --> 00:53:28.060
That was his hope.
那是他的期望。

1337
00:53:28.120 --> 00:53:28.620
That's his goal.
那是他的目标。

1338
00:53:28.820 --> 00:53:29.620
That's his goal.
那是他的目标。

1339
00:53:29.860 --> 00:53:33.300
So, but yeah, Angela is now super ticked because now there's alcohol.
所以，但是没错，安吉拉现在超级生气，因为现在有酒了。

1340
00:53:33.760 --> 00:53:36.020
I'm surprised her whole head didn't explode.
我很惊讶她的整个脑袋竟然没有爆炸。

1341
00:53:36.240 --> 00:53:40.140
Well, it's about to, because the next two are what set it into motion.
嗯，快要炸了，因为接下来两幕就是导火索。

1342
00:53:40.440 --> 00:53:40.680
Oh, boy.
天哪。

1343
00:53:41.060 --> 00:53:46.040
Well, now we have the scene where Jim is trying to get the teapot back from Dwight.
好了，现在我们看到吉姆试图从德怀特那里拿回茶壶的场景。

1344
00:53:46.240 --> 00:53:50.740
Jim offers to trade him the shamrock keychain, and he says, come on, it'll be good luck.
吉姆主动提出用三叶草钥匙扣跟他交换，并且他说，来吧，这会带来好运的。

1345
00:53:50.840 --> 00:53:56.360
And that's when Dwight has his line, a real man makes his own luck, Billy Zane, Titanic.
就在那时，德怀特说出了那句台词：“好汉自己造运势”，比利·赞恩，《泰坦尼克号》。

1346
00:53:56.360 --> 00:54:05.420
And Angela, you made the entire cast t-shirts with that quote on them, and I still have mine.
而安吉拉，你给整个剧组都定制了印有这句名言的T恤，我到现在还留着我的那件。

1347
00:54:05.500 --> 00:54:06.660
Oh, my gosh, you do.
哦天哪，你还留着。

1348
00:54:06.680 --> 00:54:07.180
I do.
我留着呢。

1349
00:54:07.280 --> 00:54:09.020
It's a gray, long-sleeved t-shirt.
那是一件灰色的长袖T恤。

1350
00:54:09.120 --> 00:54:10.340
Yes, with black writing.
是的，上面印着黑色的字。

1351
00:54:10.520 --> 00:54:11.980
And it's just a quote across it.
上面还印着一句名言。

1352
00:54:12.040 --> 00:54:12.240
Yeah.
对。

1353
00:54:12.240 --> 00:54:17.880
So, I had a friend at the time who had a t-shirt press because she had a small business,
当时我有个朋友有一台T恤印花机，因为她开了家小店，

1354
00:54:17.880 --> 00:54:21.240
and I loved this line so much.
我太喜欢这句话了。

1355
00:54:21.240 --> 00:54:25.020
I thought it was hilarious of all people for Dwight to quote.
我觉得德怀特能引用这句话简直太搞笑了。

1356
00:54:25.020 --> 00:54:26.440
It would be Billy Zane.
居然会是比利·赞恩。

1357
00:54:26.700 --> 00:54:29.080
Well, people were asking if we gave each other gifts.
哦，大家都在问我们有没有互送礼物。

1358
00:54:29.220 --> 00:54:29.820
That was a gift.
那就算是一件礼物。

1359
00:54:29.880 --> 00:54:30.440
You gave that out.
那是你送的。

1360
00:54:30.520 --> 00:54:32.540
I think you actually gave that out at Christmas that year.
我想你那年圣诞节真的送了这个。

1361
00:54:32.660 --> 00:54:34.360
I did, and you gave everyone an ornament.
我是送了，而你送了每个人一个装饰品。

1362
00:54:34.620 --> 00:54:38.800
Yes, I got that cast photo, and I had it printed on an ornament for everyone.
对，我拿到了那张演员合照，然后印在装饰品上送给了每一个人。

1363
00:54:39.060 --> 00:54:39.260
Yep.
没错。

1364
00:54:39.840 --> 00:54:40.100
Aw.
噢。

1365
