is based on something that Greg Daniels has actually done.
这个情节是以格雷格·丹尼尔斯现实中做过的事为原型的。

1367
00:54:50.180 --> 00:54:51.420
Like with a neti pot?
就像用洗鼻壶那样？

1368
00:54:51.420 --> 00:54:55.400
Yeah, I mean, but I've never put green tea in a neti pot.
对，我是说，但我从来没在洗鼻壶里加过绿茶。

1369
00:54:55.720 --> 00:54:56.760
I haven't either.
我也没有。

1370
00:54:56.760 --> 00:54:59.340
I've only used the saline solution that is recommended.
我只用过推荐的生理盐水。

1371
00:54:59.680 --> 00:55:02.740
But I could see Greg reading about it and giving it a try.
但我能想象格雷格看到相关报道后去尝试的样子。

1372
00:55:02.740 --> 00:55:13.000
But Rain, the way Rain was in that scene, and he like shoved that teapot into his nostril.
但是雷恩，雷恩在那个场景里的表现，他把那个茶壶直接塞进了鼻孔里。

1373
00:55:13.260 --> 00:55:13.500
Yeah.
对。

1374
00:55:13.880 --> 00:55:17.960
And just John's face as Jim is just like, are you kidding me?
还有约翰作为吉姆的表情，那简直就像是在说，你在开玩笑吧？

1375
00:55:18.220 --> 00:55:20.820
That, that's who gets my teapot?
就是，这就是拿走我茶壶的人？

1376
00:55:21.040 --> 00:55:22.320
Like, it's so perfect.
真的太绝了。

1377
00:55:22.540 --> 00:55:23.620
He's so bummed.
他太郁闷了。

1378
00:55:23.620 --> 00:55:30.740
Now, when I watched this with Lee, Lee said he wondered how Dwight didn't find the note
话说我跟李一起看这一集时，李说他很好奇德怀特怎么没发现盒子里的纸条，

1379
00:55:30.740 --> 00:55:35.760
in the box, or how Dwight didn't open up the teapot.
或者德怀特怎么没打开茶壶看看。

1380
00:55:35.920 --> 00:55:37.160
I thought of all of those things.
这些我都想过。

1381
00:55:37.300 --> 00:55:41.080
I thought Dwight now has the cassette and the sauce packet.
我想着现在德怀特拿到了磁带和酱料包。

1382
00:55:41.920 --> 00:55:42.460
Yeah.
对。

1383
00:55:42.460 --> 00:55:47.160
I mean, so you have to sort of suspend belief, I guess, at that moment that, that he took
我是说，所以在那个时刻你大概得暂且相信，他把那些东西拿出来，然后随手扔在了一边。

1384
00:55:47.160 --> 00:55:48.380
those out and just shoved them aside.
就像是，嗯，这是什么破烂？

1385
00:55:48.520 --> 00:55:49.500
Like, hmm, what's this crap?
然后就随手把它们丢在了盒子里。

1386
00:55:49.680 --> 00:55:51.300
And just sort of shoved them aside in the box.
而且，我觉得吉姆拿回茶壶并不是为了潘。

1387
00:55:51.500 --> 00:55:54.980
Well, also, I don't think Jim is trying to get the teapot back for Pam.
我觉得他拿回茶壶纯粹是为了他自己。

1388
00:55:55.200 --> 00:55:57.940
I think he's just trying to get the teapot back for himself.
他现在打算自己留着了。

1389
00:55:58.040 --> 00:55:59.260
He's just going to keep it now.
我觉得那里的动机就是这样。

1390
00:55:59.480 --> 00:56:01.100
That's what I think the motivation is there.
因为潘当时在那个，你知道的，在前台和罗伊一起看她的新iPod。

1391
00:56:01.240 --> 00:56:06.600
Because Pam is over, you know, up at the desk with Roy looking through her new iPod.
我觉得吉姆想把它要回来，是因为我觉得里面有让人尴尬的东西。

1392
00:56:06.740 --> 00:56:09.840
I think Jim just wants to get it back because I think there's things inside it that
对，没错。

1393
00:56:09.840 --> 00:56:10.380
are embarrassing.
但他打算用钥匙扣去交换，而且现在就要把那个茶壶带回家了。

1394
00:56:10.580 --> 00:56:11.260
Yes, exactly.
所以潘在前台，正在向罗伊展示她的新iPod。

