1421
00:57:14.440 --> 00:57:16.060
She is pissed.
她气疯了。

1422
00:57:16.360 --> 00:57:17.220
Oh, no.
哦，不。

1423
00:57:17.700 --> 00:57:19.600
And it's only going to get worse.
而且情况只会越来越糟。

1424
00:57:19.960 --> 00:57:23.180
That's not even still the worst thing that's happened to Angela.
这甚至还不是安吉拉遇到的最糟糕的事。

1425
00:57:23.420 --> 00:57:23.660
Nope.
没错。

1426
00:57:23.660 --> 00:57:26.000
