他得在上面躺好久。

1448
00:58:11.320 --> 00:58:14.620
So he laid down on those desks, which were not comfortable, right?
所以他躺在那些一点也不舒服的桌子上，对吧？

1449
00:58:14.740 --> 00:58:16.320
And then they silly stringed his head.
然后他们把彩带喷在他头上。

1450
00:58:16.740 --> 00:58:19.980
And then we had all these scenes where that's what he's doing.
接着我们拍了所有他一直在做那种事的戏份。

1451
00:58:20.180 --> 00:58:24.520
Well, if he got up, all the stuff that he was decorated in would have fallen off.
好吧，如果他站起来，他身上那些装饰品全都会掉下来。

1452
00:58:24.600 --> 00:58:26.360
It would have been impossible to recreate.
那就根本不可能再还原了。

1453
00:58:26.380 --> 00:58:29.720
So he had to just lay there, even when we were on a break.
所以他只能一直躺在那儿，甚至在我们休息的时候也是。

1454
00:58:29.720 --> 00:58:31.180
Even when we were on a break.
甚至在我们休息的时候也是。

1455
00:58:31.360 --> 00:58:32.560
And he was such a trooper.
而且他真的超敬业。

1456
00:58:32.700 --> 00:58:33.380
Talk about a trooper.
说真的，太敬业了。

1457
00:58:33.580 --> 00:58:39.740
And I wrote in my MySpace blog that Kate and I, because Kate and I knew Dave from Improv Days.
我在我的MySpace博客里写过，凯特和我——因为凯特和我从即兴表演时期就认识戴夫了。

1458
00:58:39.800 --> 00:58:41.880
We had all done improv shows together.
我们以前一起演过很多即兴喜剧。

1459
00:58:42.140 --> 00:58:46.160
That Kate and I walked over and talked to him while he had to lay on his back.
凯特和我走过去跟他说话，当时他只能躺在地上。

1460
00:58:46.460 --> 00:58:49.600
And we just sort of caught up and that it was so fun to see him.
我们顺便叙了叙旧，见到他真的太开心了。

1461
00:58:49.600 --> 00:58:57.220
But I want you guys to know, if you're wondering what Todd Packer looks like at 20 minutes, 19 seconds, to really paint a picture here.
但我得让你们知道，如果你想知道托德·帕克在20分19秒时是什么样子，我来给你们描绘一下画面。

1462
00:58:57.300 --> 00:58:57.500
Yeah.
对。

1463
00:58:57.660 --> 00:59:03.300
He's laying on his back kind of across a desk area partition, right in the middle of the room.
他仰面躺着，横跨在一个办公桌的隔板上，就在房间正中央。

1464
00:59:03.300 --> 00:59:14.360
He has blue silly string on his head, Christmas lights around his torso, Christmas garland around his torso, Dwight's desk nameplate on his stomach.
他头上粘着蓝色的彩带，身子缠着圣诞彩灯，缠着圣诞花环，肚子上放着德怀特的办公桌名牌。

1465
00:59:14.760 --> 00:59:21.120
And there's like a red empty solo cup kind of just like in his, like the crook of his arm.
然后还有一个红色的空塑料红杯，就卡在他的胳膊弯里。

1466
00:59:21.500 --> 00:59:25.340
And he had to lay like that with all those things on top of him.
他身上堆着所有这些东西，就得这么一直躺着。

1467
00:59:25.340 --> 00:59:28.120
He passes out so quickly.
他醉得真快。

1468
00:59:28.280 --> 00:59:31.680
You have to imagine he showed up already half drunk.
你得想他来的时候就已经半醉了。

1469
00:59:31.860 --> 00:59:32.800
You know he did.
你知道他绝对是。

1470
00:59:32.820 --> 00:59:33.560
You know he did.
你知道他绝对是。

1471
00:59:33.640 --> 00:59:34.480
You know he did.
你知道他绝对是。

1472
00:59:34.720 --> 00:59:35.680
Okay, guys.
好了，各位。

1473
00:59:35.860 --> 00:59:42.580
So now we have the scene where Pam reveals to Jim that she got her teapot back.
接下来这场戏是帕姆向吉姆透露她把茶壶要回来了。

1474
00:59:43.280 --> 00:59:46.800
She trades Dwight the iPod for the teapot.
她用iPod跟德怀特换回了茶壶。

1475
00:59:46.800 --> 00:59:50.100
And now she's going to look inside and find all the iteMs.
现在她要打开看看里面所有的东西。

1476
00:59:50.100 --> 00:59:51.880
And it's very charming and sweet.
这一幕非常迷人又温馨。

1477
00:59:51.880 --> 00:59:53.280
And she is so delighted.
她高兴坏了。

1478
00:59:53.280 --> 00:59:58.960
But in this moment, Jim secretly steals the note back and puts it in his pocket.
但就在这时，吉姆偷偷把纸条又偷了回来，放进了自己口袋。

1479
00:59:59.220 --> 00:59:59.820
I know.
我知道。

1480
00:59:59.820 --> 01:00:01.380
He lost his courage.
他当时怂了。

1481
01:00:01.380 --> 01:00:02.260
He did.
确实如此。

1482
01:00:02.560 --> 01:00:10.680
Now, when we reached out to fans to ask them what they wanted to know about the Christmas episode,
话说回来，当我们联系粉丝询问他们想了解关于圣诞节这一集的什么内容时，

1483
01:00:10.680 --> 01:00:19.340
I would say that about 80% of the comments and emails we received were along the lines of what is in the teapot note.
我可以说，我们收到的大约80%的评论和邮件都在问茶壶纸条里写了什么。

1484
01:00:19.340 --> 01:00:23.120
Because, as you know, in this episode, Pam does not read it.
因为如你所知，这一集里帕姆并没有看。

1485
01:00:23.260 --> 01:00:24.180
