01:01:10.140 --> 01:01:15.920
And if I'm going to say something that I've never said before, I also feel like I'm maybe going to cry.
而且如果我要说出一些我从未说过的话，我也觉得我可能会哭。

1504
01:01:16.360 --> 01:01:16.880
What?
什么？

1505
01:01:17.140 --> 01:01:17.600
Wait.
等等。

1506
01:01:18.080 --> 01:01:18.600
Wait.
等等。

1507
01:01:18.900 --> 01:01:19.280
What?
什么？

1508
01:01:19.940 --> 01:01:22.840
Are you going to say what was in the note?
你要说信里写了什么吗？

1509
01:01:23.360 --> 01:01:25.040
Are you going to say what was in the note?
你要说信里写了什么吗？

1510
01:01:26.320 --> 01:01:27.120
Sort of.
算是吧。

1511
01:01:27.580 --> 01:01:30.100
Because I don't know what was on that card.
因为我不知道那张卡片上写了什么。

1512
01:01:30.340 --> 01:01:31.180
None of us do.
我们谁都不知道。

1513
01:01:31.640 --> 01:01:34.140
I'm the only one who knows, and John knows.
我是唯一知道的人，约翰也知道。

1514
01:01:34.600 --> 01:01:36.160
Oh my gosh, lady.
噢，天哪，我的姐们。

1515
01:01:36.520 --> 01:01:40.060
In that episode in season nine, I believe Greg suggested,
在第九季的那集里，我相信格雷格建议过，

1516
01:01:40.140 --> 01:01:47.940
to John, that he write a personal message from himself to me,
约翰，让他写一段他自己给我个人的寄语，

1517
01:01:50.740 --> 01:01:54.600
just saying what our time together on The Office meant to him.
就是说说我们一起在《办公室》共事的时光对他的意义。

1518
01:01:54.700 --> 01:01:55.460
Oh, Jenna.
噢，珍娜。

1519
01:01:56.900 --> 01:01:58.520
Because we were wrapping up filming.
因为我们当时正在杀青。

1520
01:01:58.680 --> 01:02:02.460
We were wrapping up the series, and we were all so emotional at that time, you know?
我们在拍摄剧集尾声，那时候我们都百感交集，你知道吗？

1521
01:02:02.780 --> 01:02:06.060
It was all, we were all sort of saying goodbye in different ways.
一切都在，我们都在以不同的方式道别。

1522
01:02:06.200 --> 01:02:06.580
We were.
确实是这样。

1523
01:02:06.580 --> 01:02:09.860
And so that was his goodbye.
所以这就是他的告别。

1524
01:02:11.000 --> 01:02:17.500
Very similar to when we filmed that scene with Steve, where I said goodbye to him at
这很像我们拍那场和史蒂夫的戏时，我在机场跟他告别，

1525
01:02:17.500 --> 01:02:22.280
the airport, and Paul Feig told me, just run up and say goodbye to your friend Steve.
保罗·费格告诉我，直接跑过去跟你的朋友史蒂夫告别就行。

1526
01:02:23.060 --> 01:02:30.120
Jeff Blitz said the same thing to me when I was in the car with Oscar, and I say I love Dwight.
杰夫·布利茨在我跟奥斯卡在车里，我说我爱德华时也跟我说了同样的话。

1527
