He said, Angela, in this moment, express your love for the show and everyone,
他说，安吉拉，在这个时刻，表达你对这部剧和所有人的爱，

1528
01:02:37.200 --> 01:02:39.520
and if you couldn't have it in your life anymore.
就好像你生命中再也没有这一切了一样。

1529
01:02:40.580 --> 01:02:41.980
And I disintegrated.
