1579
01:04:45.820 --> 01:04:46.500
Am I really?
真的吗？

1580
01:04:46.720 --> 01:04:46.920
Yes.
是的。

1581
01:04:46.920 --> 01:04:47.480
Oh, my gosh.
噢，天哪。

1582
01:04:47.480 --> 01:04:48.380
I didn't even notice.
我甚至都没注意到。

1583
01:04:48.680 --> 01:04:49.700
That is so funny.
