01:04:59.640 --> 01:05:03.760
She's left the party, and now I have some stuff to tell you guys about this scene.
她离开了派对，现在我有些关于这场戏的事要告诉大家。

1591
01:05:03.900 --> 01:05:03.950
Oh, yeah.
噢，是的。

1592
01:05:04.600 --> 01:05:05.040
All right.
好吧。

1593
01:05:05.260 --> 01:05:06.800
20 minutes, 16 seconds.
20分16秒。

1594
01:05:07.100 --> 01:05:09.440
The ultimate Angela pissed-offness has happened.
安吉拉终极愤怒爆发了。

1595
01:05:09.940 --> 01:05:11.780
So here's some behind the scenes of this scene.
所以这里有一些这场戏的幕后花絮。

1596
01:05:12.340 --> 01:05:16.160
You have a guy up on the roof, and he's got the soap snow.
屋顶上有一个人，他拿着肥皂雪。

1597
01:05:16.480 --> 01:05:16.760
Yep.
没错。

1598
01:05:16.880 --> 01:05:17.500
That he's going to-
他打算——

1599
01:05:17.500 --> 01:05:18.420
Falling into your eyes.
掉进你的眼睛里。

1600
01:05:18.500 --> 01:05:19.020
He's going to-
他打算——

1601
01:05:19.020 --> 01:05:19.160
Yeah.
