It was just me and Charles McDougal, Randall Einhorn, and Mike Schur.
当时只有我和查尔斯·麦克杜格尔、兰德尔·艾因霍恩以及迈克·舒尔。

1606
01:05:32.580 --> 01:05:34.660
So it was just kind of a skeleton crew at this point.
所以到这个时候，基本上只剩核心精简剧组了。

1607
01:05:34.740 --> 01:05:36.620
Those are always some of my most favorite shoots.
那一直是我最喜欢的一些拍摄时光。

1608
01:05:36.880 --> 01:05:37.780
Yeah, me too.
对，我也是。

1609
01:05:37.880 --> 01:05:39.860
And we did not have a lot of time.
而且我们时间不多。

1610
01:05:40.390 --> 01:05:41.760
We didn't have a lot of time to get this.
我们没有太多时间来拍这个。

1611
01:05:41.880 --> 01:05:42.580
Oh, the clock was ticking.
哦，时间紧迫。

1612
01:05:42.880 --> 01:05:43.580
Yeah, exactly.
对，确实如此。

1613
01:05:43.580 --> 01:05:47.400
Because we didn't want to go into overtime for everyone, and it was the end of the day.
因为我们不想让所有人都加班，而且当时已经是收工的时候了。

1614
01:05:47.660 --> 01:05:53.820
And so Charles McDougal said to me, we're probably only going to do like two takes, you know, maybe three.
所以查尔斯·麦克杜格尔对我说，我们大概只拍两遍，你知道的，也许三遍。

1615
01:05:54.160 --> 01:06:01.480
But they gave me these ornaments, and my instruction was that my character has just lost it.
但他们给了我这些装饰品，给我的指令是我的角色已经彻底崩溃了。

1616
01:06:01.580 --> 01:06:03.360
Michael has ruined Christmas.
迈克尔毁了圣诞节。

1617
01:06:03.920 --> 01:06:05.700
Kelly has kissed my man.
凯莉亲了我的男人。

1618
01:06:05.900 --> 01:06:08.480
Ryan is the king of the party planning committee.
瑞安成了派对策划委员会之王。

1619
01:06:09.780 --> 01:06:14.380
He said, I want you to take these ornaments and just throw them and shatter them.
他说，我希望你拿着这些装饰品，然后直接把它们扔出去砸碎。

1620
01:06:14.540 --> 01:06:17.220
They were written in the script as glass ornaments.
剧本里写的是玻璃装饰品。

1621
01:06:17.960 --> 01:06:19.600
They were not glass ornaments.
它们根本不是玻璃装饰品。

1622
01:06:19.840 --> 01:06:20.100
What?
什么？

1623
01:06:20.360 --> 01:06:21.180
Watch the scene.
看这场戏。

1624
01:06:21.340 --> 01:06:21.940
I throw them down.
我把它们扔下去。

1625
01:06:22.180 --> 01:06:24.220
They bounce straight up in the air.
它们直接在空中弹了起来。

1626
01:06:24.380 --> 01:06:25.160
What were they?
那是什么材质的？

1627
01:06:25.300 --> 01:06:28.180
They were like some kind of plastic composite whatever.
它们好像是某种塑料复合材料之类的东西。

1628
01:06:28.560 --> 01:06:29.200
Oh, no.
噢，不。

1629
01:06:29.500 --> 01:06:31.360
So when you look, watch it, you guys.
所以当你们看的时候，大家注意看。

1630
01:06:31.460 --> 01:06:32.960
You see them bounce in the air.
你们会看到它们在空中弹跳。

1631
01:06:32.960 --> 01:06:35.680
I assumed, well, that makes sense.
我当时想，好吧，这倒也合情合理。

1632
01:06:35.860 --> 01:06:42.680
We did not have the budget to get special breakaway glass ornaments, and there's no way they would give you real glass.
我们没有预算买特制的易碎玻璃装饰品，而且他们绝不可能给你真的玻璃。

1633
01:06:42.840 --> 01:06:43.200
No.
没错。

1634
01:06:43.440 --> 01:06:46.440
So these things bounced like a tennis ball.
所以这些东西弹起来就像网球一样。

1635
01:06:46.700 --> 01:06:48.780
And so Charles is like, cut.
然后查尔斯就喊了，停。

1636
01:06:48.880 --> 01:06:50.520
And he goes, okay, two things.
他说，好吧，有两件事。

1637
01:06:50.740 --> 01:06:53.320
One, we need you to stand closer to the wall.
第一，我们需要你站得离墙更近一些。

1638
01:06:53.320 --> 01:06:59.400
Like, if you can in the scene, get as close to the wall as possible, because that's where the guy is with the soap coming down.
如果在戏里可以的话，尽量贴近墙壁，因为那是负责弄泡沫撒下来那家伙的位置。

1639
01:06:59.600 --> 01:07:01.300
The soap doesn't ball very far.
泡沫弹不了多远。

1640
01:07:01.460 --> 01:07:03.200
So we have another take.
所以我们重拍了一条。

1641
01:07:03.700 --> 01:07:05.520
And he's like, why aren't you breaking the ornaments?
然后他说，你怎么不把装饰品砸碎？

1642
01:07:05.660 --> 01:07:06.680
I'm like, Charles, they're bouncing.
我说，查尔斯，它们在弹跳啊。

1643
01:07:06.840 --> 01:07:07.500
What are you talking about?
你在说什么呢？

1644
01:07:07.660 --> 01:07:08.740
