他说，你能用力点扔吗？

1645
01:07:08.880 --> 01:07:10.540
I was like, yeah, they're just going to bounce higher.
我说，行啊，它们只会弹得更高而已。

1646
01:07:11.300 --> 01:07:13.000
And I was like, okay, I got it.
然后我说，好吧，我明白了。

1647
01:07:13.040 --> 01:07:13.360
I got it.
我懂了。

1648
01:07:13.380 --> 01:07:13.980
I have an idea.
我有个主意。

1649
01:07:15.240 --> 01:07:17.500
So I know now we're really running out of time.
所以我知道现在时间真的不多了。

1650
01:07:17.500 --> 01:07:29.160
So, and Michael Gallenberg had taken the most awesome photo that I have, and it's the snow falling and me throwing the ornaments and Charles McDougal in the distance watching me.
所以，迈克尔·加伦贝格拍了一张我这辈子见过最棒的照片，画面里是飘落的雪花、我正在扔装饰品，还有远处的查尔斯·麦克杜格尔在看着我。

1651
01:07:29.560 --> 01:07:30.840
Oh, that's great.
哦，太棒了。

1652
01:07:30.980 --> 01:07:32.720
Michael Gallenberg, our set designer.
迈克尔·盖伦伯格，我们的布景师。

1653
01:07:32.840 --> 01:07:33.900
Yeah, he took this photo.
对，这张照片是他拍的。

1654
01:07:34.040 --> 01:07:34.560
It was so cool.
真的很酷。

1655
01:07:34.720 --> 01:07:36.020
But anyway, here I am.
不过总之，我在这儿。

1656
01:07:36.200 --> 01:07:37.120
We're running out of time.
我们时间不多了。

1657
01:07:37.340 --> 01:07:38.060
I got to stand.
我得站起来。

1658
01:07:38.180 --> 01:07:39.420
I got to get myself to the wall.
我得走到墙边。

1659
01:07:39.600 --> 01:07:42.040
I got to throw these ornaments, and I need them to break.
我得把这些装饰品扔出去，而且我需要它们碎掉。

1660
01:07:42.340 --> 01:07:44.040
And I have to shriek, right?
我还得尖叫，对吧？

1661
01:07:44.640 --> 01:07:47.360
So I throw them with, I said, I'm going to throw them harder this time.
所以我扔的时候，我说，我这次要用力扔。

1662
01:07:47.360 --> 01:07:47.820
I don't know.
我不知道。

1663
01:07:48.020 --> 01:07:49.440
So I threw them as hard as I could.
所以我用尽全力把它们扔了出去。

1664
01:07:50.040 --> 01:07:51.280
They bounced up higher.
它们弹得更高了。

1665
