Was that your intention going in when you're like, I have an idea.
你进去的时候就是这么打算的吗，当时心想，我有个主意。

1667
01:08:00.680 --> 01:08:01.120
I can do it.
我能做到。

1668
01:08:01.160 --> 01:08:01.440
I can do it.
我能做到。

1669
01:08:01.440 --> 01:08:04.720
I was thinking if I can't get them to break, I have to start stomping on them.
我在想，如果我弄不碎它们，我就得开始踩了。

1670
01:08:04.760 --> 01:08:05.080
Yes.
是的。

1671
